# Written by an install, so a fresh install leaves `git status` empty
# (6.0.1, Matthias 2026-11-09). Nothing here is tracked.
# - tests/test_data/: the test fixtures. They left the repository in
#   v3.26.3 (all 20, the SINEX head12 fixture included) and live at the
#   tag fixtures-2026-08; CI checks them out here, the installer fetches
#   them here. User-supplied SINEX archives for
#   testUserSuppliedSINEXFiles go here too (GitHub rejects files > 100 MB).
# - tests/runAllTests_results.txt: runAllTests' log, overwritten each run.
# - html/helpsearch-v*/: builddocsearchdb's index, built by
#   setup_shAnalysis(Docs = true) on the machine that searches it.
tests/test_data/
tests/runAllTests_results.txt
html/helpsearch-v*/
__pycache__/

# generated by shLowLevel.makeTutorials - regenerate, do not commit
tutorials/

# built by CI (tools/dev/make_guide.py) and attached to each GitHub release
# since v5.24.1 - not committed; doc_sync_audit refuses a tracked copy
docs/shAnalysis_workflow_guide.pdf
